{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"מִזְמוֹר שִׁיר לְיוֹם הַשַּׁבָּת: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92/2","n":"2"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"טוֹב לְהֹדוֹת לַ"}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יהֹוָה"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" וּלְזַמֵּר לְשִׁמְךָ עֶלְיוֹן: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92/3","n":"3"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"לְהַגִּיד בַּבֹּקֶר חַסְדֶּךָ וֶאֱמוּנָתְךָ בַּלֵּילוֹת: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92/4","n":"4"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"עֲלֵי־עָשׂוֹר וַעֲלֵי־נָבֶל עֲלֵי הִגָּיוֹן בְּכִנּוֹר: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92/5","n":"5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"כִּי שִׂמַּחְתַּנִי "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְהֹוָה"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" בְּפָעֳלֶךָ בְּמַעֲשֵׂי יָדֶיךָ אֲרַנֵּן: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92/6","n":"6"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"מַה־גָּדְלוּ מַעֲשֶׂיךָ "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְהֹוָה"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" מְאֹד עָמְקוּ מַחְשְׁבֹתֶיךָ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92/7","n":"7"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"אִישׁ בַּעַר לֹא יֵדָע וּכְסִיל לֹא־יָבִין אֶת־זֹאת: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92/8","n":"8"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"בִּפְרֹחַ רְשָׁעִים כְּמוֹ עֵשֶׂב וַיָּצִיצוּ כָּל־פֹּעֲלֵי אָוֶן לְהִשָּׁמְדָם עֲדֵי־עַד: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92/9","n":"9"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"וְאַתָּה מָרוֹם לְעֹלָם "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְהֹוָה"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":": "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92/10","n":"10"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"כִּי הִנֵּה אֹיְבֶיךָ "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְהֹוָה"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" כִּי־הִנֵּה אֹיְבֶיךָ יֹאבֵדוּ יִתְפָּרְדוּ כָּל־פֹּעֲלֵי אָוֶן: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92/11","n":"11"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"וַתָּרֶם כִּרְאֵים קַרְנִי בַּלֹּתִי בְּשֶׁמֶן רַעֲנָן: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92/12","n":"12"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"וַתַּבֵּט עֵינִי בְּשׁוּרָי בַּקָּמִים עָלַי מְרֵעִים תִּשְׁמַעְנָה אָזְנָי: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92/13","n":"13"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"צַדִּיק כַּתָּמָר יִפְרָח כְּאֶרֶז בַּלְּבָנוֹן יִשְׂגֶּה: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92/14","n":"14"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"שְׁתוּלִים בְּבֵית "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְהֹוָה"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" בְּחַצְרוֹת אֱלֹהֵינוּ יַפְרִיחוּ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92/15","n":"15"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"עוֹד יְנוּבוּן בְּשֵׂיבָה דְּשֵׁנִים וְרַעֲנַנִּים יִהְיוּ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92/16","n":"16"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"לְהַגִּיד כִּי־יָשָׁר "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְהֹוָה"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" צוּרִי וְלֹא־עַוְלָתָה בּוֹ: "}
